/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A lot of efforts are put in to break away from captivity and to enjoy freedom. For anyone, freedom is much more important than any kind of comfort, growth or development. Even if we have all the riches in the world but no freedom, we do not really have anything. Freedom is essential for all living beings be it man, a bird or trees. All beings strive for freedom and are happiest when free.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
